        "semantic_kind": "課題",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 872",
        "original_text": "drive letterだけのBindingや偶発的な容量枯渇は、別Diskへの誤書込みや重要Dataの先行喪失を招き得る。"
      },
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L1840",
        "semantic_kind": "課題",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 1840",
        "original_text": "契約、承認、期限、認証、鮮度、Healthを追跡できないと、失効Serviceやstale Dataを利用し得る。"
      }
    ],
    "purposes": [
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0874",
        "semantic_kind": "目的",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 874",
        "original_text": "marker identityを検証し、容量圧迫時に重要度順で安全に縮退する。"
      },
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L1842",
        "semantic_kind": "目的",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 1842",
        "original_text": "外部ServiceのLifecycleと運用状態を判定できるRegistry属性を定義する。"
      }
    ],
    "design_reasons": [],
    "processes": [
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0876",
        "semantic_kind": "対象",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 876",
        "original_text": "Data Root、marker、Environment Binding、Storage Pressure Degradation、Position Watch Minimum Data。"
      },
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0886",
        "semantic_kind": "table_row",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 886",
        "original_text": "| 1 | News / optional raw、Historical expansion、Discovery bulk、non-critical report | 最初に停止 |"
      },
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0887",
        "semantic_kind": "table_row",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 887",
        "original_text": "| 2 | Application Log、Candidate raw、non-critical archive / derived regeneration | Canonical情報より先に縮退。Application Logは保持量を有限にする |"
      },
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0888",
        "semantic_kind": "table_row",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 888",
        "original_text": "| 3 | Canonical State、Human Decision / Correction / Execution Fact、Audit / Incident、Queue / reservation、recent local backup | 最後まで保護 |"
      },
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0889",
        "semantic_kind": "table_row",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 889",
        "original_text": "| 4 | Position Watch Minimum Data | 重大Risk監視のため最後まで取得・Normalizeを優先 |"
      },
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0890",
        "semantic_kind": "table_row",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 890",
        "original_text": "| 5 | Minimum Dataも保存不能 | `POSITION_WATCH_DATA_UNAVAILABLE`をInvestment P0 Incident化し、監視継続を装わない |"
      },
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0892",
        "semantic_kind": "Application Log境界",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 892",
        "original_text": "単独の書込み失敗はCanonical Commitまたは投資Canonical処理を失敗させず、可能な範囲で観測可能にする。同一Storage障害がCanonical安全性を損なう場合はStorage Fail Closedを適用する。外付けData Rootに加え、内蔵SSD上のCanonical State、直近Backup、Application Logについてvolume free、directory usage、growthを監視する。警告閾値とApplication Logの具体的保持期間・cleanup方法は未確定である。"
      },
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0894",
